Usage: semaphore-cli lint [<config_file>] [flags]

🛑 Lint Semaphore configuration file.

🛑 Validate Semaphore configuration file, it will return an error if your file is
not valid.

Arguments:
  [<config_file>]    Path to your Semaphore configuration file.

Flags:
  -h, --help             Show context-sensitive help.
  -v, --version          Print the version and exit

  -f, --format="yaml"    Format of your input file (YAML, JSON or TOML)
